{
  "_comment": [
    "Starting model lists for the HawkNodes dropdowns. Atlas serves 400+ models and",
    "publishes no machine-readable index, so this file is a curated seed rather than a",
    "complete catalogue. After the first successful chat call the LLM dropdown also",
    "merges whatever GET /v1/models reports (cached in .models_cache.json, visible",
    "after a ComfyUI restart). For anything not listed, pick the `custom` option and",
    "type the id into `model_override`.",
    "",
    "`params` selects which widget group a model shows in the image nodes. Only the",
    "gpt-image-2 groups are confirmed against a working implementation; `generic`",
    "sends nothing beyond model/prompt/seed unless you set a size, which keeps",
    "unfamiliar models from 400-ing on a parameter they do not accept."
  ],

